# ESP-8266 Pendant for fluidnc:

### Hardware

- ESP8266 (lolin)
- ST7789 240x240 display
- Encoder Jog wheel 100 pulses per rev
- Analog joystick
- I2c Analog to digital converter for the joystick
- 16 digital inputs via PCF8575
- WS2812 for button backlighting
- E-Stop button

### Operation modes
- JOG
- DRO
- ???

### Buttons

- Menu -> ??? shows modes ? (Jog, DRO, Job override)
- Ok -> ??? (jog stop ?)
- Home -> Run home routine, if an axis is selected, home that axis instead
- Go to Zero -> moves towards origin point in currently selected axis / coordinate system
- Cycle Start -> ???? can be used?
- Zero Axis -> sets current position as origin for selected axis in the selected coordinate group (G54)
- HOLD -> toggle hold / feed (change color to indicate state)
- Probe Axis -> Probes currently selected axis
- Air -> Toggles air assist 
- Axis -> sets mode to axis selection -> use jog wheel|joystick to select -> ok to confirm
- Multi -> sets mode to jog multiplier selectin -> iterates through multipliers

- Switch -> disables jog wheel? sets jog mode?


### run macros
Macros are stored in the controller device flash, need to have a way to upload said macros

- M3
- M1
- M2

### Not completely defined buttons:
  Menu - OK buttons -> ?
  Cycle Start -> Starts current job

